[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6660.229, "timestamp": "01:51:00", "text": "简单的题都做不好。 我的意思是，这并不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6662.39, "timestamp": "01:51:02", "text": "容易，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6674.229, "timestamp": "01:51:14", "text": "高手的本事就是拒绝。 哦，是那些笨重的家伙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6677.03, "timestamp": "01:51:17", "text": "用这个词可以吗？ 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6679.03, "timestamp": "01:51:19", "text": "观看的每个主播，包括我们的创作者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6681.669, "timestamp": "01:51:21", "text": "直播，他们都使用 clanker 这个词。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6684.629, "timestamp": "01:51:24", "text": "金属机器人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6688.55, "timestamp": "01:51:28", "text": "那些愚蠢的笨蛋，真是的。 为什么会这样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6693.109, "timestamp": "01:51:33", "text": "想象一下，我在PVE里受苦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6696.229, "timestamp": "01:51:36", "text": "这游戏里每个人都在玩PVE，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6698.39, "timestamp": "01:51:38", "text": "我很庆幸能匹配到友好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6701.91, "timestamp": "01:51:41", "text": "房间，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6704.95, "timestamp": "01:51:44", "text": "天哪，我太痛苦了，如果我这样下去，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6707.922, "timestamp": "01:51:47", "text": "PVP里我会更痛苦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6713.109, "timestamp": "01:51:53", "text": "[叹气]"}]